{
  "name": "dsh-koi",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "锦鲤 —— 让 DSH 里的 agent 在开奖日研究历史走势后出号（双色球/大乐透/排列三投注档位制），通知走事件层与可插拔渠道（内置桌宠面板渠道），开奖后自动对账记模拟账本；每彩种关/手动/自动三态运行；本地全量开奖底座 + 学习拆卡入库 + 回测引擎（第二波）。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "lottery",
    "shuangseqiu",
    "daleto",
    "p3"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.0-0",
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test tests/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "tools",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "tests"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
